# Allowlist: the only image built from this repo is the web app
# (docker build -f webapp/Dockerfile .). Everything else — config.yaml,
# deploy/k3s/s3-secret.yaml, logs/, backups/, .state/, .git — stays out of the
# build context so it can never be copied into an image.
*
!webapp/
webapp/**/__pycache__
webapp/**/*.py[cod]
